    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d299">

                <pb facs="0417" n="[417]" sameAs="frus:frus1861/pg417"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Crosby to Mr. Seward</hi>.</head>
                <note rend="inline" type="source">[Extract.]</note>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the
                            United States</hi>,<lb/><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Guatemala</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1861-06-01"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 1, 1861</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: * * * * * * * * *</p>
                <p>His excellency the President of Guatemala and his ministers, as well as the other
                    officers and gentlemen of the government and country, all express their great
                    friendship for the government and people of the United States, and especially
                    their fervent hope that the present administration might successfully suppress,
                    the disturbances in portions of the southern States, and maintain the Union in
                    all its integrity.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I have the honor, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>E. O. CROSBY.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. H. Seward</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
